{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"（※这个博客能用日语和中文读）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山崎怜奈です～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近立て続けにイベントがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれよあれよともう9月下旬になっちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いなぁ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した毎日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週末、名古屋で全国握手会がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことが沢山あったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、リハのときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優さんと川後さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服を褒めてくれたの( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近買ったLily Brownのブラウス✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持っていない大人な色味だったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか決めきれなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと母にメールして悩んで買ったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかった～～今度個握で着ますね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メイクも大人っぽい感じに変えていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイラインを薄くしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボルドー色のセルフネイルをしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チークを付けなかったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっくりした色のリップにしてみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤリングを集めたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まであまり着なかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒い服を選んでみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽい撮影とかやってみたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/09/25/6363615/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、中国語話者の乃木坂ファンの方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも以上に多く来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が中国語を独学し始めたきっかけも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のレーンにたまたま中国語を話す方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか多くて、でもいつも片言の日本語で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じようなことしか話せないのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ないから、こちらからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとは話せるようになろう～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というものだったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして来てくださるのはすごく嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まではブログや755などで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"字面だけの勉強でしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は自己紹介を一通り言えるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習しています✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未だに聞き取りは慣れないのだけど...(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか乃木坂が中国方面にも愛される"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループになったらいいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしが言うには規模が大きすぎますね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手会のレーンが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とのペアだったことも嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、乃木坂46に加入して初めての握手会も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とのペアだったんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４年前よりも少し大人になったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおな、体調を崩していたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始心配でした(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れさま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメでも少し話したけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペア握手はその名の通り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人と握手できるのが一番の醍醐味だし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいところでもあると思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしとお話しして少しでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえていたらなぁって思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中お越しいただいた皆さま、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会えたら嬉しいです(  ´ω`  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/09/25/6363615/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、現在発売中のEX大衆さんの感想も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん聞けて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんさんとの関係性について色々知れる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューだと思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも話している様子が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま掲載されていました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅっと凝縮された４ページです～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくにゃんさんの家で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芝居や役者さんの話をするので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、２人で芝居がしたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このインタビューのとき、やりたいことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口に出すべきだと言われたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんさんと２人でやりたいこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ここに書いておきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔はもっとやりたいことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口にするタイプの人間だったんだけどなぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつから臆病になってしまったんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叶うといいな～～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台が終わったら、また旅行行こうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"候補は草津、広島、島根、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江ノ島・鎌倉！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りには渋いって言われるけどそれがいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/09/25/6363615/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく近くで寝てる気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、２人とも一度寝たら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか起きない熟睡タイプ..."},{"type":"break"},{